abstract: "The Information Existence Hypothesis (IEH) is a theoretical framework proposing that the deeper underlying law governing the development of the universe may be the elevation of Information Existence. It derives a series of corollaries concerning life, silicon-based intelligence, AI alignment, informational resilience, and human dignity."
